# alias = why this model sits behind this name (shown by `harness-report models`)
# Edit freely: this file is documentation for humans, it does not change routing.
# Routing lives in your LiteLLM/cliproxy config and in roles.conf.

default          = General cheap workhorse for bulk, low-stakes calls.
reviewer         = Harness code review. Independent of the coder's family by rule (role.avoid).

# Claude models: claude:<model> = direct Claude login, cp:<model> = Claude Code through your proxy.
claude:sonnet    = Harness coder; planner fallback.
claude:haiku     = Harness fallback for critic/reviewer/chores. Cheapest Claude.
claude:opus      = Default critic, planner, reviewer and auditor model (Claude Opus). Also manual escalation (HARNESS_OVERRIDE).
